; icons (docs/ART.md 11.5): line-and-mass glyphs in bone 7/6 with one accent colour and a void
; outline (nearly invisible on soot panels, a contrast edge over the map). icon16/ for panels and
; the top bar, icon8/ inline in text and on map tiles. Names follow the game's [ICON_*] keys:
; yields (food production commerce), commerces (gold research culture espionage), happy unhappy
; angrypop healthy unhealthy greatpeople strength moves defense experience bullet; then the empire
; marks of the top bar: turn, turn_wait, armageddon_low|mid|high|doom (the counter's steps 0, 50,
; 75, 100), golden_age, anarchy, research_needed, idle_city, ai_idle, stasis, mana.
; Category fallbacks (names starting with _) are recoloured by the mapping (`remap=`).

